'''Sant Jorge Airport''' ({{lang|ca|Aeroport de Sant Jorge}}; [[IATA airport code|IATA]]: SJD, [[ICAO airport code|ICAO]]: SJIB) is a domestic airport serving [[Sant Jorge]], a town in the far north of [[Tramuntana Province]], [[Balboa]]. The airport is turboprop-only and operates as an essential services destination, connecting the remote northern highland community to the national network. [[Aeroístmus]] serves the airport from [[Portblanc Airport|Portblanc]] as a stop on the route from [[Sant Cristòfor International Airport|Sant Cristòfor]].

